        "TileImage": "$($repository d3d91885-ca30-4e5a-9f1f-8ca8673ca5d0).Image",
        "Description": "After the end of World War II, the world was split into two -- East and West. This marked the beginning of the era called the Cold War. A soviet colonel aims to overthrow the current government and escalate the war using a revolutionary new weapon. He has an army and the special Serpent unit at his disposal. The Kremlin wants the colonel and the unit taken out of the picture. They are currently in the Ambrose Forest, where they are continuing their work. Good hunting.",
